@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:Gross pathology request that has arrived;
:proceed with the Registration gross pathology request;
:create a barcode scan at the start;
:assign a container to the gross pathology request;
:move on to the Specimen description;
:pay attention to the scan start;
:pay attention to the scan end;
:pay attention to the scan start again for the Registration gross pathology request (cont.) step;
split
:proceed with Macroscopic description writing;
split again
:Tissue processing;
:check if "Digitalization?" is required;
:v1: check Digitalization required first time ({yes, no}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = "no"])
:continue the process;
else ([v1 = "yes"])
:proceed with Digitalization;
endif
:check if "Digitalization?" is required again;
:v2: check Digitalization required second time ({yes, no}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v2 = "no"])
:continue the process;
else ([v2 = "yes"])
:proceed with Digitalization;
endif
end split
:assign cases to the pathologist;
:move on to Microscopic examination and diagnosis;
:write the pathology report;
:confirm it;
:deliver it;
:proceed with the post-report processing;
:To conclude the pathology procedure;
:close it;
:deliver the pathology report and complete the post-report processing;
stop
@enduml